@startuml
title 003 搶答與結果判定 - 類別圖

class RealtimeHub {
  -connections: Set<ConnectionContext>
  +submitAnswer(context, questionId, answerText)
  +getTeacherProgress(context)
  +getStudentResults(context)
  +sendOwnProgress(context)
}

class ConnectionContext {
  role: TEACHER | STUDENT | UNAUTHENTICATED
  groupId: string | null
}

class ActivityState {
  stage: PREPARING | BUZZING | ENDED
  questions: Question[]
}

class GroupRoster {
  ids: string[]
  +has(groupId)
}

class Question {
  questionId: string
  displayOrder: number
}

class BuzzerResultsService {
  +submitAnswer(groupId, questionId, answerText)
  +getSubmission(groupId, questionId)
  +getWinner(questionId)
  +getOwnProgress(groupId)
  +getTeacherProgress()
  +getStudentResults(groupId)
  -submissions: Map<GroupSubmission>
  -winners: Map<WinningResult>
  -nextReceivedOrder: number
}

class GroupSubmission {
  groupId: string
  questionId: string
  answerText: string
  receivedOrder: number
  acceptedAt: number
  locked: boolean
}

class OwnQuestionProgress {
  questionId: string
  submitted: boolean
  answerText: string | null
  locked: boolean
}

class TeacherQuestionProgress {
  questionId: string
  groups: GroupProgress[]
  winningGroupId: string | null
  winningAnswer: string | null
}

class GroupProgress {
  groupId: string
  submitted: boolean
  answerText: string | null
}

class StudentQuestionResult {
  questionId: string
  ownAnswer: string | null
  ownStatus: SUBMITTED | NOT_SUBMITTED
  winningGroupId: string | null
  winningAnswer: string | null
  ownGroupWon: boolean
}

interface WinningResultsProvider {
  +getSnapshot()
}

class BuzzerWinningResultsProvider
class GuidedNotesService
class GoogleSheetsAdapter

RealtimeHub "1" o-- "0..*" ConnectionContext
RealtimeHub --> BuzzerResultsService : authorizes and dispatches
RealtimeHub --> ActivityState : reads current phase
RealtimeHub --> GroupRoster : validates joined group
BuzzerResultsService --> ActivityState : reads ordered questions and stage
BuzzerResultsService --> GroupRoster : validates groups and roster order
BuzzerResultsService "1" o-- "0..*" GroupSubmission : stores accepted answers
ActivityState "1" o-- "0..*" Question
BuzzerResultsService ..> OwnQuestionProgress : creates group-only reconnect state
BuzzerResultsService ..> TeacherQuestionProgress : creates full teacher view
BuzzerResultsService ..> StudentQuestionResult : creates ENDED student view
BuzzerWinningResultsProvider ..|> WinningResultsProvider
BuzzerWinningResultsProvider --> BuzzerResultsService : reads winners
BuzzerWinningResultsProvider --> ActivityState : checks readiness
GuidedNotesService --> WinningResultsProvider : requests authoritative snapshot
GuidedNotesService --> GoogleSheetsAdapter : writes only server results

note right of GroupSubmission
One accepted entry per group and question.
The first valid entry locks that pair;
receivedOrder determines the winner.
end note

note bottom of StudentQuestionResult
Student results contain the winning answer
and the requesting group's own answer only.
end note
@enduml
